{% comment %}
@description: Trang chu — port y het noi dung tu chatbot-lite/web/src/components/LandingPage.tsx (ban tieng Viet), giu nguyen cau truc 10 muc: Hero, Problem, Reframe, LoopExample, Features (4 khoi + mock UI), WhyChoose, Infrastructure, AudienceFit, Pricing, FAQ, CtaBand.
@required_substrings: {% layout "layout" %}, {% block content %}, {% endblock %}, posts, products
@required_ids: how-it-works, features, pricing, faq
@notes: Day la noi dung MARKETING TINH (khong doc post[]/products[] tu DB nhu ban home.liquid truoc day) - dung y nguyen van ban cua chatbot-lite, chi doi mau sac hardcode (blue-600/#0A132B/blue-50) sang token "brand"/"brand-dark"/"brand-light" da co san trong layout.liquid (trung mau 1:1). Link CTA "/auth/form" (route rieng cua chatbot-lite, khong ton tai o site-engine) doi thanh https://account.leadbase.vn (dung chung domain dang nhap that voi header.liquid/footer.liquid); "/images/app-icon.png" doi thanh {{ site.logoUrl }} (co dieu kien). Icon dung SVG inline (lucide paths), khong dung React/lucide-react. Neu can ghep lai post[]/products[] dong nhu ban cu, phai them section rieng - KHONG tu y xoa cac section marketing nay.
{% endcomment %}
{% layout "layout" %}
{% block content %}

<!-- Hero -->
<section class="px-6 py-16 md:py-24" style="background-image: radial-gradient(60% 55% at 50% 0%, rgba(22,119,255,.10), transparent 65%), radial-gradient(circle, rgba(13,71,161,.10) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: auto, 22px 22px;">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[860px] text-center">
        <span class="mb-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-blue-50 px-3 py-1.5 text-[13px] font-medium text-brand">
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand"></span> AI Business Operator
        </span>
